    {
      "sort": 300000,
      "name": "弹药 Ammunition",
      "type": "rule",
      "_id": "s0HqR6Vd6twQCq7k",
      "system": {
        "tooltip": "",
        "type": "rule"
      },
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 2
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>使用具有弹药词条的武器发动远程攻击时，你必须拥有该武器需求的弹药。所需弹药的种类会与武器的射程写在一起。每次使用该武器攻击都会花费一枚弹药，且取出该弹药的行为视为此次攻击的一部分（你需要一只空手来为一把单手武器装上弹药）。在战斗结束后，你可以花费一分钟搜索战场，以回收所消耗的弹药的一半（向下取整），而剩下的那些弹药将会损失。</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "Jqoj9dwIRPPEU1Xu": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "13.351",
        "systemId": "dnd5e",
        "systemVersion": "4.0.0",
        "createdTime": 1729044105083,
        "modifiedTime": 1729044323663,
        "lastModifiedBy": "Jqoj9dwIRPPEU1Xu",
        "exportSource": null
      },
      "category": null,
      "_key": "!journal.pages!vF1Kqptk2gQmyq9P.s0HqR6Vd6twQCq7k"
    },
    {
      "sort": 600000,
      "name": "灵巧 Finesse",
      "type": "rule",
      "_id": "TkMcwZ9jaCrhMdOu",
      "system": {
        "tooltip": "",
        "type": "rule"
      },
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 2
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>使用一把灵巧武器发动攻击时，你可以自由选择此次攻击检定与伤害掷骰使用力量调整值，还是敏捷调整值。但是攻击检定与伤害掷骰必须使用同一个调整值。</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "Jqoj9dwIRPPEU1Xu": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
      "_stats": {
        "compendiumSource": null,
        "duplicateSource": null,
        "coreVersion": "13.351",
        "systemId": "dnd5e",
        "systemVersion": "4.0.0",
        "createdTime": 1729053454717,
        "modifiedTime": 1729053476410,
        "lastModifiedBy": "Jqoj9dwIRPPEU1Xu",
        "exportSource": null
      },
      "category": null,
      "_key": "!journal.pages!vF1Kqptk2gQmyq9P.TkMcwZ9jaCrhMdOu"
    },
    {
      "sort": 700000,
      "name": "重型 Heavy",
      "type": "rule",
      "_id": "BZ1fzlDRDfsb47cu",
      "system": {
        "tooltip": "",
        "type": "rule"
      },
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 2
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<p>如果你的力量属性值低于 13 点，则你用重型近战武器发动的攻击检定具有劣势；如果你的敏捷属性值低于 13 点，则你用重型远程武器发动的攻击检定具有劣势。</p>"
      },
      "video": {
        "controls": true,
        "volume": 0.5
      },
      "src": null,
      "ownership": {
        "default": -1,
        "Jqoj9dwIRPPEU1Xu": 3
      },
      "flags": {},
